{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-01-12 16:00:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS WORKS WITH HOMEBUILDERS TO INCREASE THE ENERGY EFFICIENCY OF OVER 13,400 NEW HOMES IN 2021, REDUCING OVER $250,000 IN UTILITY BILLS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES, JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) TODAY ANNOUNCED OVER 13,400 NEW SINGLE-FAMILY RESIDENTIAL UNITS AND MULTI-FAMILY PROJECTS HAVE ENROLLED IN THE 2021 ENERGY EFFICIENT NEW HOMES (EENH) PROGRAM, WHICH ENABLES HOMEBUILDERS TO CONSTRUCT ENERGY EFFICIENT HOMES AT A LOWER COST AND CONTINUES TO DELIVER ON SOCALGAS' COMMITMENT TO REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS (GHG). THE RESULT IS HIGHER LEVELS OF EFFICIENCY AND UTILITY BILL SAVINGS FOR FUTURE RESIDENTS."}